| $0.07$ | $0.08$ | $0.09$ | $0.02$ |\n\nCalculate $\\text{E}[0.5X].$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's find $\\text{E}[X].$ \n\nThe expected value of a discrete random variable $X$ with probability mass function $f(x)$ and sample space $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\text{E}[X]={\\sum }_{x\\in S}x\\cdot f(x).\n$$\n\nSumming up the products of each value of $X$ and its associated probability, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[X] & ={\\sum }_{x\\in S}x\\cdot f(x) \\\\  & =0\\cdot 0.74+1\\cdot 0.07+2\\cdot 0.08+3\\cdot 0.09+4\\cdot 0.02 \\\\  & =0.58.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{E}[0.5X] & =0.5\\text{E}[X] \\\\  & =0.5\\cdot 0.58 \\\\  & =0.29.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186366924 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186157384 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "5449da36-9aae-591d-bab6-7ed55d7d9d4b" :knowledge-point/title "Computing the Expected Value of a Transformed Random Variable"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5d1357ab-bcec-5a00-839a-f55254249f1c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "20" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366926} {:answer/id #uuid "de48f599-e372-52af-ac5c-7d472b0147dd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "23" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366927} {:answer/id #uuid "79cf7170-6c58-5639-bb56-12cb583f59f0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "17" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366928} {:answer/id #uuid "548097fb-8380-56b7-acb9-f2be6c627802" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366929} {:answer/id #uuid "0d3bb225-c641-5cf5-b1ac-e98e6b7e8d59" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-17" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186366930}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "79cf7170-6c58-5639-bb56-12cb583f59